  "metadata": {
    "description": "M_Mount.Service is the main node. A M_Mount.Client injects mount position: two Sources.Iterators sweep azimuth and elevation, are composed into a MountPositionType by Factory.M_Mount::MountPositionType, and re-emitted on ReportMountPosition - plotted via Debug.GraphDisplay after Transform.Extract pulls out Azimuth and Elevation. A M_HidJoystick Service/Client pair carries EventButton presses atomically: trigger buttons feed Factory.M_HidJoystick::EventButton_Args structs into the service, the client re-emits each as one EventButton_Args message into Input.ButtonHandler's args input, and the handler's Start Az / Stop Az / Start El / Stop El outputs start and stop the iterators.",
